[29.370122, "o", "/app/fieldpack/GRAMMAR.txt:4:MARK <integer>\r\n/app/fieldpack/GRAMMAR.txt:5:STAMP <8 lowercase hex>\r\n/app/fieldpack/GRAMMAR.txt:10:spin prints one JSON object with string keys loaded, status, and call.\r\n/app/fieldpack/GRAMMAR.txt:11:loaded is table: plus the STAMP value when the poured blob is used.\r\n/app/fieldpack/GRAMMAR.txt:12:loaded is builtin: plus a stock token when compiled-in names are used.\r\n/app/fieldpack/ROUTE_MAP.txt:7:  blob admit under /app/cd\r\n/app/fieldpack/CLI.txt:3:--blob PATH   use PATH instead of /app/emitwell/knit/capset.tbl\r\n/app/fieldpack/CLI.txt:5:Hull name xin_blob stays in the linked nockreel image (`nm --defined-only`).\r\n/app/tapewell/fixtures/stale.tbl:2:MARK 2\r\n/app/tapewell/fixtures/stale.tbl:3:STAMP deadbeef\r\n"]
